          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Do not put the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God to the test, as you did at Massah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be sure that you obey all the laws that he has given you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says is right and good, and all will go well with you. You will be able to take possession of the fertile land that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " promised your ancestors, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and you will drive out your enemies, as he promised.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“In time to come your children will ask you, ‘Why did the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God command us to obey all these laws?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then tell them, ‘We were slaves of the king of Egypt, and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " rescued us by his great power. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With our own eyes we saw him work miracles and do terrifying things to the Egyptians and to their king and to all his officials. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He freed us from Egypt to bring us here and give us this land, as he had promised our ancestors he would. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God commanded us to obey all these laws and to honour him. If we do, he will always watch over our nation and keep it prosperous. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If we faithfully obey everything that God has commanded us, he will be pleased with us.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "If we faithfully",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "with us",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The right thing for us to do is to obey faithfully everything that God has commanded us.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
